  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC041 no longer flags a primary-key lookup written with the key predicate on a Where step before First (the same single-row-by-key fetch as First with the predicate inline) — one of the most common EF read patterns. The key-lookup exemption previously inspected only the terminal operator's inline predicate; it now also walks the receiver chain for a Where whose predicate is a primary-key equality. A non-key Where still reports. (Found by a second adversarial false-positive rescan.)",
